<title>LATVIA: LIEPAJA FISH IN 39,905 LATS Q1 LOSS.</title>
<headline>LIEPAJA FISH IN 39,905 LATS Q1 LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liepaja fish cannery had a first quarter loss of 39,905 lats on net turnover of 298,400 lats, the Riga stock exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>Liepaja had production costs of 296,243 lats during the first three months and sales costs of 10,457 lats, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>Liepaja's loss before extraordinary posts and taxes came to 2,681 lats, the bourse added.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
